# Level 0 → Level 1

## Concept
Level 0 is about basic SSH connection and reading a file. The goal 
is simply to log in and find the password for the next level stored 
in a file called `readme` in the home directory.

## Commands used
ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
cat readme

## Why it works
`ssh` connects to the remote Bandit server using the given username 
and port. Once logged in, i used ls to list and `cat` prints the contents of a file directly 
to the terminal — since the password was stored in plain text in a 
file called `readme`, `cat`ing it reveals it immediately.
